=== niri
## Global shortcuts
Record toggle                            [Mod][Shift][R]
Record over                              [Mod][Shift][O]
Discard last take                        [Mod][Shift][D]
Bind these in niri to record while another app has focus. <Copy snippet> Paste into ~/.config/niri/config.kdl
